@startuml
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4267B2
  ActorBorderColor #4267B2
  LifeLineBorderColor #4267B2
}

title DSD - CI/CD Flow (GitHub Actions)

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "GitHub Repo" as Repo
participant "GitHub Actions (CI)" as CI
participant "Docker Registry" as Registry
participant "Kubernetes (Dev)" as K8sDev
participant "Kubernetes (Prod)" as K8sProd

Dev -> Repo: Push / Pull Request
Repo -> CI: Trigger workflow

CI -> CI: Lint (ruff, mypy)
CI -> CI: Tests (pytest, vitest)
alt Tests fail
  CI --> Dev: ❌ PR failed
  stop
else Tests pass
  CI -> CI: Build Docker image
  CI -> Registry: Push image (tag: sha)
end

alt main / develop branch
  CI -> K8sDev: Deploy automatically (dev)
  CI --> Dev: ✅ Deployed to dev
else release / tag branch
  CI --> Dev: ⏳ Waiting for manual approval
  Dev -> CI: Approve production deploy
  CI -> K8sProd: Deploy manually (production)
  CI --> Dev: ✅ Deployed to prod
end
@enduml